------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Demo fixture
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`demo/saas` began as the Apache-2.0 NexusOS Semantic synthetic SaaS fixture and
is maintained here as a derivative demonstration target. This project adds a
stable ID to the safe sign-out control for deterministic graph binding. The
committed `demo/nexus-graph` is generated output from the Nexus crawler.
Attribution is preserved in `demo/saas/README.md`.
